percona-valkey (9.2.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Bump to Valkey 9.2.0 (built from the upstream 9.2.0 tag).
  * Build with BUILD_ZSTD=yes for Zstandard streaming compression, linking the
    static libzstd shipped in libzstd-dev; upstream requires >= 1.4.7 and links
    it statically.
  * Record the lz4 that Valkey 9.2 vendors in deps/lz4 in debian/copyright.
  * Refresh the patch series against the 9.2 source: 0002 keeps only the
    deps/lz4 CPPFLAGS hunk, since 9.2 passes CPPFLAGS through src/, linenoise,
    fpconv and hdr_histogram itself.

 -- Evgeniy Patlan <evgeniy.patlan@percona.com>  Mon, 12 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000

